{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17107140","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17107140","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1710714001:1":{"text":"わっ！本当にそっくりだわ！","source_cn":"哇！这两柄石中剑看起来简直一模一样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81CD7CDABCCFEE09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710714002:1":{"text":"確かに……聖光の輝きから、台座へ伸びる線の軌跡まで、全く同じです。","source_cn":"确实……从圣光的光晕，到底座延伸的轨迹……几乎分毫不差。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BD4FBE3C98C4B17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710714003:1":{"text":"マーリン様たちが本物のカリバーンを見つけてくださらなかったら、おそらくデューラ様にしか見分けがつかなかったでしょうね。","source_cn":"如果不是梅林大人他们找到真正的石中剑，或许只有艾雅女神...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDFF78FFCC6A044D0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"マーリン様たちが本物のカリバーンを見つけてくださらなかったら、おそらくデューラ様にしか見分けがつかなかったでしょうね。","female":"マーリン様たちが本物のカリバーンを見つけてくださらなかったら、おそらくデューラ様にしか見分けがつかなかったでしょうね。","variant_male_record_index":"224887","variant_female_record_index":"224888","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710714004:1":{"text":"……ねえ、カスティー。お兄様はどうしてこんなことをしたんだと思う？","source_cn":"……科丝蒂，你说，哥哥他为什么要这么做呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FAA4B28D68B21B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710714005:1":{"text":"ペギー様……あの、これは本で読んだことなのですが…… ","source_cn":"殿下，我……我只是从书上读到过……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE4C